{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Subtraction\" title=\"Subtraction\">difference</a> between a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e57018ba69e26e957e6aec2be47d2ae5cac6ddeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.5\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"14\" /> sales tax and a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/1/021ef37ec8c9c772a954b9035e2c721a63edb3af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" /> sales tax on an item priced at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/555360df10d7f3448442d43c277f763b0d1236bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> before tax is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/5/ec5bdc2c0e59651ee5e6fa74ba318dc73d744feb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/5/e75cab7d4975b612eb6762ca949a021a608bd40a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$.01$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/2/5e226c2f5a445f0a9ab589c1337336ea7587b36e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/5/b75bbdf7ba9613636f9fc9520d50caf35e62941e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$.10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/8/988a15926640244e366e55b6e468af2e3e60047e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/4/2d49c61a8115a822f1a2f0cc03d281ad2d1a9a32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$ .50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/d/87d32bac8c5abe4d6b299d444f24a8055279b232.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/a/99a3fbfb198561bee14769b5a9fbb39e139ffcfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$ 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/3/fb3626ff02d0ba34a6ae1421f4b5e155992ec4cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/f/1af88c1534bab510152766fb60851db0c3a5af52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>With a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e57018ba69e26e957e6aec2be47d2ae5cac6ddeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.5\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"14\" /> sales tax, an item costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc67b9b39b44dc593051d52b3ffc9917f04948d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.065$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> times its listed price, while with a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/1/021ef37ec8c9c772a954b9035e2c721a63edb3af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" /> sales tax, it costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/0/4f012b6206b4a3e1d365d5299aef5d0422936e25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.06$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" /> times its listed price.  The difference between these prices is therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/5/f6536c21467faf4d7b844c76df0f878fcf76fd23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.065 - 1.06 = .005$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"154\" height=\"15\" /> times its listed price.  For this item, this difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/9/f8977c5ff2bf587eaf9779222d3190ce5a98c663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.005 \\cdot \\$20 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\$.10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"176\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>With a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e57018ba69e26e957e6aec2be47d2ae5cac6ddeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.5\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"14\" /> sales tax, the item costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/1/fa11f5a267ac2e9441d75daa56bc5ece60ec523c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.065 \\cdot \\$20 = \\$21.30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"158\" height=\"16\" />.  With a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/1/021ef37ec8c9c772a954b9035e2c721a63edb3af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" /> sales tax, the item costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/b/e7b73e4a6e199b480c08ed36eb42c76ddd89ab3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.06 \\cdot \\$20 = \\$21.20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"149\" height=\"16\" />.  So the difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/0/71052c89da935a36a4f842c9420011d8fcb31a88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$21.30 - \\$21.20 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\$.10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"227\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/DTx0CwhOU0o\">https://youtu.be/DTx0CwhOU0o</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME\" title=\"1985 AJHSME\">1985 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems